{"time_ns": 1792763199518288939, "kind": "result", "action_index": 13, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "cc8f301aa45a407d89c3d75bacd507bcfc5d18ff2e3fedbbd755ef4a556bfaf4", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Executive Summary\nThis report provides regional totals aggregated from the records dataset.\n\n## Data Overview\n- **Records Processed**: 18 records\n- **Record IDs**: R002, R003, R004, R006, R007, R008, R010, R011, R012, R014, R015, R016, R018, R019, R020, R022, R023, R024\n- **Regions Covered**: North, South, West\n\n## Regional Totals (in cents)\n| Region | Total |\n|--------|-------|\n| North  | 340,388 |\n| South  | 399,267 |\n| West   | 228,759 |\n| **Grand Total** | **968,414** |\n\n## Key Findings\n- **South** is the highest region by total amount (399,267 cents)\n- **North** is the second highest region (340,388 cents)\n- **West** is the lowest region (228,759 cents)\n- The South region accounts for approximately 41.2% of the total regional spending\n\n## Methodology\nAll records from the input CSV file were read and aggregated by region using the amount_cents column. The totals represent the sum of all transactions for each region.\n", "ok": true}
